 -- off:
 HashAggregate
   Group Key: a
   ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on lion_pdt
         Recheck Cond: (b = 2)
         ->  Bitmap Index Scan on lion_pdt_b
               Index Cond: (b = 2)
(11 rows)

